\b Hiring Room - Demo Video Script\b0\par
Track 1: Best Business Workflow. About 100 seconds.\par
\par
\b Setup\b0\par
Record on Windows with Xbox Game Bar (Win+G). Capture the Mattermost hiring-room window. Narrate with any mic or headset. One clean take beats a polished montage. Do not run a fresh CV live on camera; narrate over the three completed runs.\par
\par
\b Beat 1 (0-10 sec): The room\b0\par
Show hiring-room and the member list with the 3 agent bots.\par
Say: "This is Hiring Room, a hiring workflow in team chat. Three agents and a hiring manager share one room."\par
\par
\b Beat 2 (10-25 sec): The job description\b0\par
Show the room instructions holding the JD.\par
Say: "The job description lives in the room once. Every agent reads from it. No re-pasting per candidate."\par
\par
\b Beat 3 (25-50 sec): Ada - full chain\b0\par
Scroll Ada's thread top to bottom.\par
Say: "The recruiter drops a CV. The screener scores 80 PASS. The bias-checker audits and clears. The interviewer posts the pack. Three agents, one thread, no handoffs lost."\par
\par
\b Beat 4 (50-65 sec): Ben - clean stop\b0\par
Show Ben's 5 REJECT.\par
Say: "Weak CVs stop at the screener. No downstream work wasted."\par
\par
\b Beat 5 (65-85 sec): Cynthia - fairness plus persistence\b0\par
Show Cynthia's fairness note, then run !list-documents.\par
Say: "The career gap was excluded twice, and packs persist as room documents anyone can open later."\par
\par
\b Beat 6 (85-100 sec): Human decides\b0\par
Show the Approved messages in Ada's and Cynthia's threads.\par
Say: "The human decides. Agents do the work, the manager owns the call. Without Switch there is no shared room, and this chain falls apart."\par
\par
\b Checklist before recording\b0\par
- hiring-room open in Mattermost, logged in.\par
- Ada, Ben, Cynthia threads loaded.\par
- Room instructions (JD) visible.\par
- !list-documents output ready to show.\par
- Approved messages posted in Ada and Cynthia threads.\par
- Close unrelated windows and mute notifications.\par
}
